[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2\u3055\u30FC\u3093\u3002\u3044\u307E\u3059\u304B\u30FC\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeriaaaa! Are you there?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3089\u3001\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u3002\n\u3069\u3046\u304B\u3057\u305F\u306E\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, if it isn\u0027t Ayesha.\nDid you need something?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5B9F\u306F\u6025\u304E\u3067\u85AC\u3092\u4F5C\u308B\u5FC5\u8981\u304C\u3042\u3063\u3066\u3001\n\u85AC\u8349\u96C6\u3081\u306B\u540C\u884C\u3092\u304A\u9858\u3044\u3057\u305F\u3044\u3093\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Actually, I need to make some medicine urgently,\nso I was hoping you could accompany me to gather herbs."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8B77\u885B\u306E\u4F9D\u983C\u306D\u3001\u3082\u3061\u308D\u3093\u69CB\u308F\u306A\u3044\u308F\u3088\uFF01\n\u3088\u304F\u58F0\u3092\u304B\u3051\u3066\u304F\u308C\u305F\u308F\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "An escort request? Of course I don\u0027t mind!\nI\u0027m glad you asked me!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\u3054\u3056\u3044\u307E\u3059\uFF01\n\u3067\u306F\u65E9\u901F\u3001\u5411\u304B\u3044\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you so much!\nLet\u0027s head out right away!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2015\u2015\u6025\u304E\u3063\u3066\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u305F\u3051\u3069\u3001\n\u306A\u3093\u306E\u85AC\u3092\u4F5C\u308B\u306E\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You said it was urgent...\nWhat kind of medicine are you making?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u98A8\u90AA\u306B\u52B9\u304F\u85AC\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s medicine for a cold."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3001\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3\u3001\u98A8\u90AA\u5F15\u3044\u3066\u308B\u306E\uFF1F\n\u305D\u308C\u306A\u3089\u4F11\u307E\u306A\u3044\u3068\u30C0\u30E1\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? Ayesha, do you have a cold?\nYou should be resting if that\u0027s the case!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3001\u3044\u3048\u3002\u308F\u305F\u3057\u3067\u306F\u306A\u304F\u3066\u3002\n\u8857\u3067\u5C0F\u3055\u306A\u5973\u306E\u5B50\u304B\u3089\u304A\u9858\u3044\u3055\u308C\u305F\u3093\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, no, not for me.\nA little girl in town asked me to make it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u59C9\u3061\u3083\u3093\u304C\u98A8\u90AA\u3092\u5F15\u3044\u305F\u304B\u3089\u3001\n\u98A8\u90AA\u3092\u6CBB\u3059\u85AC\u3092\u4F5C\u3063\u3066\u307B\u3057\u3044\u3063\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She said her big sister caught a cold,\nso she wanted me to make medicine to cure it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u3093\u3060\u3001\u305D\u3046\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3002\n\u304A\u59C9\u3061\u3083\u3093\u601D\u3044\u306E\u512A\u3057\u3044\u59B9\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, I see.\nWhat a caring little sister."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u98A8\u90AA\u3092\u5F15\u3044\u305F\u3068\u304D\u3063\u3066\u3001\n\u8EAB\u4F53\u304C\u91CD\u304F\u306A\u3063\u3066\u3001\u3044\u3064\u3082\u3088\u308A\u5143\u6C17\u304C\n\u51FA\u306A\u304F\u306A\u308B\u306E\u3088\u306D\uFF1F\u3000\u591A\u5206",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "When you have a cold,\nyour body feels heavy and you don\u0027t have\nas much energy as usual, right? Probably..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3044\u3046\u3068\u304D\u3001\u5468\u308A\u306E\u4EBA\u304C\n\u85AC\u306E\u4ED6\u306B\u3057\u3066\u3042\u3052\u3089\u308C\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3063\u3066\n\u4F55\u304B\u306A\u3044\u304B\u3057\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "At times like that, I wonder if there\u0027s\nanything else people around you can do\nbesides giving medicine?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4F53\u8ABF\u5D29\u3055\u308C\u305F\u3053\u3068\u306A\u3044\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Have you never been sick before?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3066\u2026\u2026\n\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u3063\u3066\u3001\u4F53\u8ABF\u3092\u5D29\u3055\u308C\u305F\u3053\u3068\n\u306A\u3044\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Could it be...\nValeria, have you never been ill before?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3048\u3002\u306A\u3044\u308F\u306D\u3002\n\u4E08\u592B\u306A\u8EAB\u4F53\u306F\u79C1\u306E\u81EA\u6162\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, I haven\u0027t.\nMy robust health is my pride!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u308F\u3041\u2026\u2026\u3059\u3054\u3044\u3067\u3059\u306D\u3002\n\u751F\u307E\u308C\u3064\u304D\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B\u3002\u305D\u308C\u3068\u3082\u3001\n\u666E\u6BB5\u306E\u98DF\u4E8B\u306B\u79D8\u5BC6\u304C\u3042\u3063\u305F\u308A\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wow... that\u0027s amazing.\nIs it natural? Or maybe there\u0027s a secret\nto your daily diet..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8A18\u61B6\u304C\u306A\u3044\u304B\u3089\u3001\n\u751F\u307E\u308C\u3064\u304D\u304B\u3069\u3046\u304B\u306B\u3064\u3044\u3066\u306F\n\u306A\u3093\u3068\u3082\u8A00\u3048\u306A\u3044\u308F\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Since I don\u0027t have my memories,\nI can\u0027t really say if it\u0027s natural\nor not."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u304D\u3063\u3068\u3001\u666E\u6BB5\u306E\u98DF\u4E8B\u306E\u304A\u304B\u3052\u304B\u3082\n\u3057\u308C\u306A\u3044\u308F\uFF01\u3000\u30D5\u30ED\u30C3\u30B1\u306E\u4F5C\u308B\u6599\u7406\u3001\n\u3068\u3063\u3066\u3082\u7F8E\u5473\u3057\u3044\u304B\u3089\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But it might be thanks to my daily meals!\nFlocke\u0027s cooking is absolutely delicious!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u81EA\u5206\u304C\u3055\u308C\u3066\u5B09\u3057\u3044\u3053\u3068\u3092\u8003\u3048\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let\u0027s think about what would make us happy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u81EA\u5206\u304C\u3055\u308C\u3066\u5B09\u3057\u3044\u3053\u3068\u3092\u8003\u3048\u3066\u307F\u308B\u306E\u306F\n\u3069\u3046\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B\u3002\u305D\u308C\u306F\u304D\u3063\u3068\u3001\n\u76F8\u624B\u306B\u3068\u3063\u3066\u3082\u5B09\u3057\u3044\u3053\u3068\u3060\u3068\u601D\u3044\u307E\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How about thinking about what would make us happy\nif we were in their position? That would probably\nbe something that would make them happy too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u308B\u307B\u3069\u3001\u3044\u3044\u8003\u3048\u306D\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3\uFF01\n\u305D\u3046\u306D\u3001\u79C1\u306A\u3089\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see, that\u0027s a great idea, Ayesha!\nLet\u0027s see, for me..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307F\u3093\u306A\u3068\u3001\u7F8E\u5473\u3057\u3044\u304A\u8089\u3092\u305F\u304F\u3055\u3093\u98DF\u3079\u308B\n\u3053\u3068\u304B\u3057\u3089\uFF01\u3000\u597D\u304D\u306A\u3082\u306E\u3092\u98DF\u3079\u305F\u3089\n\u5143\u6C17\u51FA\u308B\u308F\u3088\u306D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Maybe eating lots of delicious meat with everyone!\nEating your favorite food always cheers you up!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u8089\u2026\u2026\u306F\u4EBA\u306B\u3088\u308B\u304B\u3082\u3057\u308C\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3002\n\u3067\u3082\u3001\u8AB0\u304B\u304C\u305D\u3070\u306B\u3044\u3066\u304F\u308C\u308B\u3063\u3066\u3044\u3046\u306E\u306F\n\u3068\u3066\u3082\u5B09\u3057\u3044\u3053\u3068\u3060\u3068\u601D\u3044\u307E\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Meat... might depend on the person.\nBut I think having someone by your side\nis always something that makes people happy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u78BA\u304B\u306B\u3001\u305D\u308C\u3060\u3051\u3067\u3082\u5143\u6C17\u304C\u51FA\u308B\u304B\u3082\u2026\u2026\uFF01\n\u5C11\u3057\u3067\u3082\u8F9B\u3055\u3084\u5BC2\u3057\u3055\u304C\u548C\u3089\u3050\u3088\u3046\u3001\n\u305D\u3070\u3067\u624B\u3092\u63E1\u3063\u3066\u3044\u3066\u3042\u3052\u305F\u3044\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You\u0027re right, just that might help...!\nI\u0027d want to hold their hand and stay by their side,\nto help ease their pain and loneliness."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3069\u3046\u3057\u3066\u305D\u3046\u601D\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What made you think that way?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3069\u3046\u3057\u3066\u305D\u3046\u601D\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F\n\u4F55\u304B\u3001\u305D\u3046\u8003\u3048\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306A\u3053\u3068\u304C\n\u3042\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What made you think that way?\nDid something happen to make you\nfeel like that?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30ED\u30C3\u30B1\u304C\u71B1\u3092\u51FA\u3057\u3066\u8F9B\u305D\u3046\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3053\u3068\u304C\n\u3042\u3063\u305F\u306E\u3002\u5BDD\u3066\u3044\u308B\u59FF\u3092\u898B\u3066\u3066\u3001\n\u305D\u3046\u601D\u3063\u305F\u3053\u3068\u304C\u3042\u308B\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke had a fever once and was suffering.\nWatching her while she was sleeping,\nthat\u0027s when I thought about it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3067\u3059\u306D\u3002\u3067\u3082\u304D\u3063\u3068\n\u30D5\u30ED\u30C3\u30B1\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306F\u3001\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u304C\n\u305D\u3070\u306B\u3044\u3066\u304F\u308C\u3066\u5B09\u3057\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3068\u601D\u3044\u307E\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see. But I\u0027m sure Flocke\nwas happy to have you\nby her side."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
