    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u308F\u305F\u3057\u304C\u59B9\u3067\u3059\u304B\u2026\u2026\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m the little sister...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 65,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u308F\u305F\u3057\u304C\u59B9\u3067\u3059\u304B\u2026\u2026\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m the little sister...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 66,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u3063\u3066\u79C1\u306E\u307B\u3046\u304C\u5E74\u4E0A\u3067\u3057\u3087\uFF1F\u3000\u591A\u5206\u3002\n\u3060\u304B\u3089\u79C1\u304C\u304A\u59C9\u3061\u3083\u3093\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, I\u0027m older than you, right? Probably.\nSo that makes me the big sister!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 67,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u308B\u307B\u3069\u2026\u2026\uFF01\n\u78BA\u304B\u306B\u304A\u59C9\u3061\u3083\u3093\u304B\u3082\u3057\u308C\u307E\u305B\u3093\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see...!\nYou might really be the big sister!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 68,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u304C\u304A\u59C9\u3061\u3083\u3093\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So Valeria is the big sister?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 69,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3058\u3083\u3042\u3001\n\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u304C\u304A\u59C9\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So does that make you\nthe big sister, Valeria?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 70,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3088\uFF01\u3000\u79C1\u304C\u304A\u59C9\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s right! I\u0027m the big sister!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 71,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3048\uFF1F\u3000\u3082\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3066\u5ACC\u306A\u306E\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Huh? Do you not like that?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 72,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3001\u3044\u3048\u3001\u305D\u3046\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\u305F\u3060\u3001\u4ECA\u307E\u3067\u8003\u3048\u305F\u3053\u3068\u304C\u306A\u304B\u3063\u305F\u306E\u3067",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, no, that\u0027s not it.\nI just never thought about it before."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 73,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u3082\u983C\u308A\u306B\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You\u0027re very reliable too, Valeria!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 74,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u3082\u983C\u308A\u306B\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You\u0027re very reliable too, Valeria!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 75,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u3042\u306D\uFF01\u3000\u308F\u305F\u3057\u306F\u304A\u59C9\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3060\u304B\u3089\uFF01\n\u983C\u308A\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3066\u5F53\u7136\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course! I\u0027m the big sister after all!\nIt\u0027s only natural that I\u0027m reliable!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 76,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3055\u3063\u304D\u3082\u9B54\u7269\u3092\u5012\u3059\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u3001\n\u3059\u3054\u304F\u304B\u3063\u3053\u3088\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You looked so cool earlier\nwhen you were fighting monsters!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 77,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\uFF1F\u3000\u79C1\u3063\u3066\u59C9\u306E\u7D20\u8CEA\u304C\u3042\u308B\u306E\u304B\u3057\u3089\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Really? I wonder if I have what it takes\nto be a big sister!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 78,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u3069\u3046\u3057\u3066\u6025\u306B\u3001\n\u308F\u305F\u3057\u304C\u59B9\u307F\u305F\u3044\u3060\u3068\u601D\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But why did you suddenly think\nI was like a little sister?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 79,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u98A8\u90AA\u3092\u5F15\u3044\u305F\u59C9\u3092\u5FC3\u914D\u3059\u308B\u5B50\u3092\u898B\u3066\n\u601D\u3063\u305F\u306E\u3002\u79C1\u306E\u50B7\u3092\u624B\u5F53\u3066\u3057\u3066\u304F\u308C\u308B\u3068\u304D\u306E\n\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3\u306B\u4F3C\u3066\u308B\u306A\u30FC\u3063\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Watching that child worry about her sick sister\nmade me think of it. It reminded me of how you\ntake care of my wounds."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 80,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u3067\u3088\u304F\u8003\u3048\u305F\u3089\u3001\n\u79C1\u306E\u304C\u5E74\u4E0A\u3060\u3063\u3066\u6C17\u4ED8\u3044\u305F\u306E\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then when I thought about it,\nI realized I\u0027m the older one!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 81,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u56F0\u3063\u305F\u3068\u304D\u306F\u3044\u3064\u3067\u3082\u983C\u3063\u3066\u306D\u3002\n\u306A\u3093\u3066\u3063\u305F\u3063\u3066\u79C1\u306F\u304A\u59C9\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306A\u3093\u3060\u304B\u3089\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You can rely on me whenever you\u0027re in trouble.\nAfter all, I\u0027m your big sister!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 82,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u3093\u306A\u3089\u300C\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2\u304A\u59C9\u3061\u3083\u3093\u300D\u3063\u3066\n\u547C\u3093\u3067\u3082\u3044\u3044\u306E\u3088\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You can even call me\n\u0027Big Sis Valeria\u0027 if you want!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 83,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3001\u3048\u3063\u3068\u2026\u2026\u306F\u3044\u3002\n\u30F4\u30A1\u3001\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2\u304A\u59C9\u3061\u3083\u3093\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, um... yes.\nB-Big Sis Valeria!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 84,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\uFF01\u3000\u306A\u3093\u304B\u2026\u2026\u3044\u3044\u308F\u306D\u3001\u3053\u308C\uFF01\n\u5BB6\u3067\u3082\u4E00\u5FDC\u3001\u9577\u5973\u3060\u3051\u3069\n\u305C\u3093\u305C\u3093\u9577\u5973\u3089\u3057\u304F\u306F\u306A\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3057",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...! This feels... nice!\nI\u0027m technically the eldest daughter at home,\nbut I never really acted like one."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 85,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3064\u3082\u306F\u304A\u59C9\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3063\u3066\u547C\u3070\u308C\u308B\u5074\u306A\u306E\u3067\n\u5C11\u3057\u7167\u308C\u307E\u3059\u3051\u3069\u2026\u2026\u308F\u305F\u3057\u3082\u5B09\u3057\u3044\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m usually the one being called big sister,\nso it\u0027s a bit embarrassing... but I\u0027m happy too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 86,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u3089\u9060\u616E\u3057\u306A\u3044\u3067\u7518\u3048\u3066\u304D\u3066\uFF01\n\u59C9\u3068\u3057\u3066\u305F\u304F\u3055\u3093\u7518\u3084\u304B\u3057\u3066\u3042\u3052\u308B\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then don\u0027t hold back!\nAs your big sister, I\u0027ll spoil you lots!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 87,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u306F\u3044\uFF01\u3000\u30F4\u30A1\u30EC\u30EA\u30A2\u304A\u59C9\u3061\u3083\u3093\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Yes! Big Sis Valeria!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ayesha"
        }
      }
    }
  }
